;
; How Warren files one engine's service record in MYRA (warren_rules.h
; WR5): its place in zxvd's feature list, whether it is on, whether it is
; regulated, how many times the owner restarted it, and when it last
; changed (ms since 1970, zxvd's clock).
^ZXWARREN(engine:i2) = enabled:i1! ^ regulated:i1! ^ restarts:i3! ^ changed:i15!
